# Compatibility data

- A status needs evidence: a spec line, a source path, a plugin JSONL event, a QEMU serial log, or an explicit manual note.
- A spec hit means the export exists. A plugin hit means it was called. A return without a bugcheck is what marks it working.
- `untested` stays `untested`. Do not turn a missing run into a pass.
- Syscall number match stays untested until a name-only reference gains ordinals. Do not invent Windows 10 22H2 ordinals.
- Structure rows store numeric offsets only. Do not paste WDK header text into the catalog.
